WEBVTT

00:04:57.329 --> 00:05:00.996
calling the child by name
and addressing his role in her life.

00:05:01.038 --> 00:05:04.038
So how can you apply these
lie-spotting techniques to your life?

00:05:04.079 --> 00:05:06.788
First, remember that many 
of the lies we encounter daily

00:05:06.829 --> 00:05:09.954
are far less serious than these examples
and may even be harmless.

00:05:09.996 --> 00:05:12.954
But it's still worthwhile
to be aware of telltale clues,

00:05:12.996 --> 00:05:17.288
like minimal self-references,
negative language,

00:05:17.329 --> 00:05:20.288
simple explanations
and convoluted phrasing.

00:05:20.329 --> 00:05:23.496
It just might help you avoid
an overvalued stock,

00:05:23.538 --> 00:05:26.204
an ineffective product,
or even a terrible relationship.